{"body":"Bumps the npm-minor-and-patch group with 2 updates in the /docs/website directory: [lino-objects-codec](https://github.com/link-foundation/lino-objects-codec) and [vite](https://github.com/vitejs/vite/tree/HEAD/packages/vite).\n\nUpdates `lino-objects-codec` from 0.9.5 to 0.9.6\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/link-foundation/lino-objects-codec/commits\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `vite` from 8.3.5 to 8.3.7\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/releases\">vite's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v8.3.7</h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update Rolldown to v1.2.18 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24038\">#24038</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/517affb174632db347a6a2426f12eab020277946\">517affb</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Miscellaneous Chores</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>enable more lint rules (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24035\">#24035</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/72f86e57dab05e87641599bff041d68821c837f3\">72f86e5</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tests</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>use <code>onTestFinished</code> for tear downs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24003\">#24003</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a579e352a66fbdce6a51d4e1f67006ccf4f91343\">a579e35</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Build System</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>generate sourcemaps in shim-deps plugin (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24023\">#24023</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/c02138c51193fd892025f0c28524dcb9e128446f\">c02138c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v8.3.6</h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>await overlapping plugin container close calls (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23935\">#23935</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/175bbeb231fe8bbf260b0b3866b30080690c4f5e\">175bbeb</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>build:</strong> resolve dynamic imports with queries appended when collecting CSS dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23909\">#23909</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/df365589738866363fff7335ed58948a5c440580\">df36558</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>build:</strong> use stable module ids in chunk import map hash signatures (fix <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23975\">#23975</a>) (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23976\">#23976</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/8069835ac32ae7682b34de55fdba6c5d2484bae0\">8069835</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>bundled-dev:</strong> allow named imports from Node built-ins (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23858\">#23858</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/4260c756944a430e897f689efcfa4f8648953488\">4260c75</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>bundled-dev:</strong> reload when hmr cannot run an entry again (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23849\">#23849</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a236886026c3a5de0680ea616de7de830d7a90e7\">a236886</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update <code>@rollup/plugin-alias</code> to v6.0.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23862\">#23862</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/67c965b1df64249bceb747037e87d22f75b3e471\">67c965b</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update all non-major dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23896\">#23896</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/46b91c5bf9c2901b8511c893bc3fc38b8bba6e4f\">46b91c5</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update all non-major dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23966\">#23966</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/b3cb0575aff63004a71301a1ec798aeea2aa05d7\">b3cb057</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update rolldown-related dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23868\">#23868</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a63eb8722e7d47d1efb710b6410c8d5e5a04a18f\">a63eb87</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update rolldown-related dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23967\">#23967</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/0105733e610dd5b770bb5397e8d9fbc54a9f6312\">0105733</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>dev:</strong> escape ANSI escape sequence for <code>server.forwardConsole</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23933\">#23933</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/4f340fdb1b619089bbf8ae5dc56c2c0866224306\">4f340fd</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>html:</strong> remove adjacent module tags on the first line (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23823\">#23823</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/eab1dc2752fcccf7f06427afc9915794e256e3bc\">eab1dc2</a>)</li>\n<li>ignore pnpm's .modules.yaml as a Vite Task input (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23634\">#23634</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/95c2daf1352b3509ec93e6e08a0eaabe23a61b28\">95c2daf</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>optimizer:</strong> detect cache dir precisely (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23912\">#23912</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/cc9bc2131d471bb4d60364614b326ada3ca7d10d\">cc9bc21</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>optimizer:</strong> resolve subpath imports (#) with Vite's resolver (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23959\">#23959</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/0fdd81e9460dd44806b2b6290603ee2c8366a54e\">0fdd81e</a>)</li>\n<li>respect <code>build.sourcemap</code> from environment (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23879\">#23879</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/82e7aa0374a15e1c67594557ab5893c91578f897\">82e7aa0</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>server:</strong> escape HTML attributes (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23995\">#23995</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a27039101e3726498063c9662da9c0c097016bd1\">a270391</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>server:</strong> preserve <code>$</code> patterns in static alias replacements (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23703\">#23703</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/1b6ed05397c0670e6114e3e1380188f0313ae590\">1b6ed05</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ssr:</strong> convert external require against built-in modules to import for <code>ssr.target=webworker</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23759\">#23759</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a711f1c6328ca7f59857ed99e32853cf49b19a15\">a711f1c</a>)</li>\n<li>use top-level <code>input</code> for SSR build when <code>build.ssr: true</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23898\">#23898</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/90bc034a97e7eccd0f3cbc69904fffa625a4c34d\">90bc034</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>wasm:</strong> reject <code>.wasm</code> outside <code>server.fs</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23914\">#23914</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/64e24670e49900c33a3d3e3c701a5ec4d76573f2\">64e2467</a>)</li>\n<li>watch files that have a query or hash referenced with <code>new URL(..., import.meta.url)</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23780\">#23780</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/e954a9cda0b5254be495a937333a0be1b8503d8f\">e954a9c</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>worker:</strong> keep chunks conflicted with unused workers that are still used by a live worker (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23956\">#23956</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/7139ef35cf6c9c0979385a467e8499fc19dfd099\">7139ef3</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Performance Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>build:</strong> remove preload link listeners on settle (fix <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23920\">#23920</a>) (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23922\">#23922</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/8109efd30319704224db3b7e3b7090348999effb\">8109efd</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>css:</strong> index rendered modules once per output for <code>cssScopeTo</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23889\">#23889</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/1b905e562aed9b47c3ab5959149bb1566eb7a9a5\">1b905e5</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Miscellaneous Chores</h3>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/blob/main/packages/vite/CHANGELOG.md\">vite's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><!-- raw HTML omitted --><a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/compare/v8.3.6...v8.3.7\">8.3.7</a> (2026-11-09)<!-- raw HTML omitted --></h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update Rolldown to v1.2.18 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24038\">#24038</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/517affb174632db347a6a2426f12eab020277946\">517affb</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Miscellaneous Chores</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>enable more lint rules (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24035\">#24035</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/72f86e57dab05e87641599bff041d68821c837f3\">72f86e5</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Tests</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>use <code>onTestFinished</code> for tear downs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24003\">#24003</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a579e352a66fbdce6a51d4e1f67006ccf4f91343\">a579e35</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Build System</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>generate sourcemaps in shim-deps plugin (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/24023\">#24023</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/c02138c51193fd892025f0c28524dcb9e128446f\">c02138c</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><!-- raw HTML omitted --><a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/compare/v8.3.5...v8.3.6\">8.3.6</a> (2026-11-05)<!-- raw HTML omitted --></h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>await overlapping plugin container close calls (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23935\">#23935</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/175bbeb231fe8bbf260b0b3866b30080690c4f5e\">175bbeb</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>build:</strong> resolve dynamic imports with queries appended when collecting CSS dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23909\">#23909</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/df365589738866363fff7335ed58948a5c440580\">df36558</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>build:</strong> use stable module ids in chunk import map hash signatures (fix <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23975\">#23975</a>) (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23976\">#23976</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/8069835ac32ae7682b34de55fdba6c5d2484bae0\">8069835</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>bundled-dev:</strong> allow named imports from Node built-ins (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23858\">#23858</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/4260c756944a430e897f689efcfa4f8648953488\">4260c75</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>bundled-dev:</strong> reload when hmr cannot run an entry again (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23849\">#23849</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a236886026c3a5de0680ea616de7de830d7a90e7\">a236886</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update <code>@rollup/plugin-alias</code> to v6.0.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23862\">#23862</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/67c965b1df64249bceb747037e87d22f75b3e471\">67c965b</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update all non-major dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23896\">#23896</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/46b91c5bf9c2901b8511c893bc3fc38b8bba6e4f\">46b91c5</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update all non-major dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23966\">#23966</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/b3cb0575aff63004a71301a1ec798aeea2aa05d7\">b3cb057</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update rolldown-related dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23868\">#23868</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a63eb8722e7d47d1efb710b6410c8d5e5a04a18f\">a63eb87</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update rolldown-related dependencies (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23967\">#23967</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/0105733e610dd5b770bb5397e8d9fbc54a9f6312\">0105733</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>dev:</strong> escape ANSI escape sequence for <code>server.forwardConsole</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23933\">#23933</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/4f340fdb1b619089bbf8ae5dc56c2c0866224306\">4f340fd</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>html:</strong> remove adjacent module tags on the first line (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23823\">#23823</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/eab1dc2752fcccf7f06427afc9915794e256e3bc\">eab1dc2</a>)</li>\n<li>ignore pnpm's .modules.yaml as a Vite Task input (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23634\">#23634</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/95c2daf1352b3509ec93e6e08a0eaabe23a61b28\">95c2daf</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>optimizer:</strong> detect cache dir precisely (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23912\">#23912</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/cc9bc2131d471bb4d60364614b326ada3ca7d10d\">cc9bc21</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>optimizer:</strong> resolve subpath imports (#) with Vite's resolver (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23959\">#23959</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/0fdd81e9460dd44806b2b6290603ee2c8366a54e\">0fdd81e</a>)</li>\n<li>respect <code>build.sourcemap</code> from environment (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23879\">#23879</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/82e7aa0374a15e1c67594557ab5893c91578f897\">82e7aa0</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>server:</strong> escape HTML attributes (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23995\">#23995</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a27039101e3726498063c9662da9c0c097016bd1\">a270391</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>server:</strong> preserve <code>$</code> patterns in static alias replacements (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23703\">#23703</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/1b6ed05397c0670e6114e3e1380188f0313ae590\">1b6ed05</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>ssr:</strong> convert external require against built-in modules to import for <code>ssr.target=webworker</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23759\">#23759</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/a711f1c6328ca7f59857ed99e32853cf49b19a15\">a711f1c</a>)</li>\n<li>use top-level <code>input</code> for SSR build when <code>build.ssr: true</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23898\">#23898</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/90bc034a97e7eccd0f3cbc69904fffa625a4c34d\">90bc034</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>wasm:</strong> reject <code>.wasm</code> outside <code>server.fs</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23914\">#23914</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/64e24670e49900c33a3d3e3c701a5ec4d76573f2\">64e2467</a>)</li>\n<li>watch files that have a query or hash referenced with <code>new URL(..., import.meta.url)</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23780\">#23780</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/e954a9cda0b5254be495a937333a0be1b8503d8f\">e954a9c</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>worker:</strong> keep chunks conflicted with unused workers that are still used by a live worker (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23956\">#23956</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/7139ef35cf6c9c0979385a467e8499fc19dfd099\">7139ef3</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Performance Improvements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>build:</strong> remove preload link listeners on settle (fix <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23920\">#23920</a>) (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23922\">#23922</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/8109efd30319704224db3b7e3b7090348999effb\">8109efd</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>css:</strong> index rendered modules once per output for <code>cssScopeTo</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/vitejs/vite/issues/23889\">#23889</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/1b905e562aed9b47c3ab5959149bb1566eb7a9a5\">1b905e5</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Miscellaneous Chores</h3>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/5def936009d2637a48d056e197aebc6242ac27c6\"><code>5def936</code></a> release: v8.3.7 (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/tree/HEAD/packages/vite/issues/24040\">#24040</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/517affb174632db347a6a2426f12eab020277946\"><code>517affb</code></a> fix(deps): update Rolldown to v1.2.18 (<a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/tree/HEAD/packages/vite/issues/24038\">#24038</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/vitejs/vite/commit/72f86e57dab05